# Ingestion Structure

## src/ingest.py

- Handles document ingestion into Qdrant vector database
- Implements semantic splitting of documents
- Contains QdrantIngestor class with methods for:
  - Collection setup and management
  - Text ingestion with embeddings
  - Semantic search functionality
- Includes CLI interface for command-line usage
